<title>USA: CompuCom Systems names CFO.</title>
<headline>CompuCom Systems names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuCom Systems Inc on Tuesday said it named Lazane Smith chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Smith, who was vice president of finance and controller, succeeds Robert Boutin, who resigned.</p>
<p>The company could not be reached immedately.</p>
